# quality-mgr, 2026-09-06, qa-phase-aw-integration-review-r2: independently
# confirmed by direct read at integrate/phase-aw@062cb44dd (also confirmed by
# req-qa, rust-service-hardening-agent, and fenix's separate production-
# readiness lane C). The route and storage layers now share one
# DIAGNOSTIC_QUERY_MAX_LIMIT=1000 constant (crates/atm-storage/src/
# diagnostics.rs:10, consumed by crates/atm-http-runtime/src/diagnostics_route.rs
# and crates/atm/src/commands/log.rs), eliminating the 5000-vs-1000
# advertised/enforced mismatch, and the route implements real cursor-based
# pagination (DiagnosticCursor/next_cursor/truncated) with a bounded
# query_deadline and multi-page tests (diagnostics_route.rs:28,305-383),
# landed via 94e817405 (feat(atm-storage): shared diagnostic query cap and
# opaque cursor), 4dac8d7a3 (feat(atm-storage-rusqlite): keyset-paginate the
# diagnostics query), and 08b4938fd (feat(atm-http-runtime): cap-align,
# paginate, and bound /v1/diagnostics), all ancestors of 062cb44dd.
